==============================================================================
A. EACH ESTIMATOR'S RESOLUTION, CALIBRATED BY THE BYTE-IDENTICAL PAIR
==============================================================================
floor = 95% half-width of the resampled relative difference between two
arms that compile to the same machine code, in percent of the estimate.
signal = (max - min) / min of the estimate across the arms that differ.
An estimator whose signal does not clear its own floor decides nothing.

  bitpack-carrier-width   pair = bitpack-carrier-d16 / bitpack-carrier-d16-control
    estimator            floor %   signal %  signal/floor
    median                  1.18      78.15          66.4
    mean                    1.48      74.63          50.5
    iqr  (spread)          47.95    3552.33          74.1
    idr  (spread)          51.86    2373.95          45.8
    mad  (spread)          59.31    3253.03          54.8
    p95  (level)            5.65      99.57          17.6
    p99  (level)            7.34     113.74          15.5
    p95-med (excess)      101.39    1331.80          13.1
    p99-med (excess)      146.71    1363.08           9.3

  bitpack-contend-decode   pair = bitpack-contend-d16 / bitpack-contend-d16-control
    estimator            floor %   signal %  signal/floor
    median                 18.36      53.44           2.9
    mean                   40.22      61.64           1.5
    iqr  (spread)         132.19      93.85           0.7
    idr  (spread)         143.81      53.60           0.4
    mad  (spread)         113.99     116.24           1.0
    p95  (level)          143.19      54.75           0.4
    p99  (level)          113.74      84.99           0.7
    p95-med (excess)      399.96      94.78           0.2
    p99-med (excess)      289.76     197.65           0.7

  bitpack-contention   pair = bitpack-contend-d16 / bitpack-contend-d16-control
    estimator            floor %   signal %  signal/floor
    median                  7.41     141.63          19.1
    mean                   66.10     398.11           6.0
    iqr  (spread)          93.23    2729.02          29.3
    idr  (spread)          86.63    5724.72          66.1
    mad  (spread)         111.77    2866.02          25.6
    p95  (level)           73.86    1324.69          17.9
    p99  (level)          221.82     475.40           2.1
    p95-med (excess)      220.10    3040.57          13.8
    p99-med (excess)      395.04    1312.45           3.3

  bitpack-wide   pair = bitpack-wide-d16 / bitpack-wide-d16-control
    estimator            floor %   signal %  signal/floor
    median                  7.82      65.83           8.4
