==============================================================================
C. WHAT EACH CANDIDATE ADDS AS A SECOND COORDINATE
==============================================================================
Exact count of sections a strictly positive weighting can reach on
{median algo_ns, candidate}, by the instrument p4 calibrates against
`97`'s published 72 and 9. One means the candidate changes nothing: no
two strategies can disagree on it.

  bitpack-carrier-width   5 arms, control dropped, 6 regions
    estimator           sections reachable
    median                               1
    mean                                 1
    iqr  (spread)                        6
    idr  (spread)                        7
    mad  (spread)                        8
    p95  (level)                         1
    p99  (level)                         1
    p95-med (excess)                     3
    p99-med (excess)                     2

  bitpack-contend-decode   4 arms, control dropped, 6 regions
    estimator           sections reachable
    median                               1
    mean                                 5
    iqr  (spread)                        7
    idr  (spread)                        6
    mad  (spread)                        7
    p95  (level)                         7
    p99  (level)                         5
    p95-med (excess)                     9
    p99-med (excess)                     8

  bitpack-contention   SKIPPED: 5^12 = 244140625 sections is beyond exhaustive enumeration

  bitpack-wide   3 arms, control dropped, 6 regions
    estimator           sections reachable
    median                               1
    mean                                 2
    iqr  (spread)                        8
    idr  (spread)                        5
    mad  (spread)                        8
    p95  (level)                         3
    p99  (level)                         2
    p95-med (excess)                     5
    p99-med (excess)                     5

